[0.691837, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34m▸ Part 1 — a run that is stuck: the infinite retry loop\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mAn agent must 'find the weather in New York & convert to Fahrenheit'.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.692038, "o", "\u001b[2mIts web_search tool times out... so it retries. And retries. Seven times,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mall identical, all failing — then the run dies with 'Maximum retries exceeded'.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34m▸ Quick read on what happened:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[33m$ autopsy summary examples/traces/loop_failure.json\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
